Peter O. Hill (pohill+@CMU.EDU) wrote:
: Hi all,
: I have a few questions concerning my Barbarian Character in NH3.1.  
: 1.  I got a wish early in the game and asked for a blessed RP Vorpal
: Blade.  I got it and since then have given it a +5 enchantment.
: Recently I pleased my god and he gave me Frost Brand.  Its neat how it
: freezes things and all, but is this power reliable and is it better
: than cutting off heads?  I'ld like some opinions on which sword I can
: keep.

Both.  The Vorpal Blade is good to use against creatures which have a
head.  Since you have enchanted it to +5, it should do good damage.  When
you enchant the Frost Brand it should work well against creatures which
are vulnerable to cold (which is most of them).  Use you own judgement.

: 2.  I've gotten pretty far down in the Dungeon and I still haven't seen
: a magic portal or any other place to start my quest.  What should I be
: looking for?  Thanks for any help you can give.

When you get to the level where you enter the quest, you should get a
telepathic message.

